# Holy Fire as the saved right skill: ScnPal (expansion Paladin, level 30, every skill at 20, right
# skill 102), -seed 1234; warp to the Blood Moor (level 2; variant blood-moor-empty) before frame 4,
# a Fallen (class 19) 2 sub-tiles away along +x before frame 10, then one right click at client pixel
# (448, 324) at frame 20. Compares the aura's start (states, stats) and its periodic fire damage on
# the Fallen over 120 frames. Area (q-fix-class-rows, q-fix-pt-right-aura). Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name pal-holyfire
save ScnPal --class pal --expansion --level 30 --all-skills 20 --right-skill 102
seed 1234
ticks 120
seconds 300
channels state
variant blood-moor-empty
at 4 poke warp 2
at 10 poke spawn 19 @x+2 @y normal
input frame 20; rclick 448 324
